---
// The root used to be a hash-forwarding redirect to the playground (it was deployed at the
// root for a day); keep that promise for any share link that carries its document here.
// An .astro component, because MDX does not understand `is:inline` and would render the
// script as JSX. The splash has no anchors of its own, so any hash is a document.
---

<script is:inline>
  if (location.hash.length > 1) location.replace("playground/" + location.hash);
</script>
